&_nc_oc=AdqJ-_jY6oxo13yJu5LzswHkcVUuqGf9f1_cZyC6nmvJea6HIySGC59GZNm97Iny8Wk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyH8V3d5tC8YF_7bNWqv520D02GcfrXu0I3Cg7wJgIo0w&oe=69D0F2FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MWzjHBtOxwQ7kNvwGQebsC&_nc_oc=AdqS7_poyfvCZjmjzu95c7BswqMWArtN7BF4OWO9shC3HrkmbCbPMfByKHTzf97TxCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afymzm7axVeI5YbaKvlIeYqdyXIViUF3RZukmjlshernAA&oe=69D103FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mpMQ-JoICEYQ7kNvwGGUiDP&_nc_oc=AdpCRQOtz7AWSyWUinppmZMzjHNVxI2liSegyNYK3jg0Y8mt3Rruu0vlV0218VK279A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw4zeZhHiCuWc0NPxOqBL3YV0mQQsnV4NkDnnlG_SHqtA&oe=69D12287"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6uxOZr-pLuwQ7kNvwFOrzMd&_nc_oc=AdqMuTCEkWnkxR6HS9qzqKxZeerW0TbNVkt4BJuZAwClACCWm-_d8V6qN7vG7yvXsTU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzpqxKicQ4WgDJ-sxJ1WR5lhG1v7Ox9DewwA6KrxFZoBA&oe=69D10E55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AustJro9TWsQ7kNvwHm50Bx&_nc_oc=AdrqyzTCRBJL_rKXBiQB8PfCReY6e4t7aY-F--8WrcVVksC-tb9ftuTvtoVFIURsAOI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxdK5XJJeNSNVLj-J6EcABesFPgU76f2Vm_yL5R6qCGOA&oe=69D11AE4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.